        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Max Cavalera, Billy Idol, Gwen Stefani, Kanal, Roberta Flack\n- Roles: singer, guitarist, songwriter, actor, musician\n- Organizations: Soulfly, Cavalera Conspiracy, Killer Be Killed\n- Works: 4 in the Morning\n- Topics: heavy metal, musical influences, songwriting\n\nFacts:\n- Billy Idol, born William Michael Albert Broad on 30 November 1955, is an English musician, singer, songwriter, and actor.\n- Max Cavalera, born Massimiliano Antonio Cavalera on August 4, 1969, is a Brazilian singer, guitarist, and songwriter.\n- Max Cavalera currently plays in the heavy metal bands Soulfly, Cavalera Conspiracy, and Killer Be Killed.\n- Gwen Stefani described “4 in the Morning” as one of her favorite songs on its album.\n- Gwen Stefani began writing “4 in the Morning” while she was pregnant and later finished it with Kanal.\n- Gwen Stefani drew inspiration from Roberta Flack and Billy Idol when writing “4 in the Morning.”",
